  "bookRefs": [
    "R-SORT-3",
    "SORT-CHECK",
    "Text levels",
    "Traversal consequences"
  ],
  "description": "New General ACCDB. T(ID Long primary key, K TEXT(40)) with the first 24 pair-corpus values; CREATE INDEX IX_K ON T (K); then, with an image kept after each: DROP INDEX IX_K; CREATE INDEX IX_K again; DROP and CREATE as IX_K2; DELETE of the even IDs; INSERT of the even IDs again in descending ID order; CREATE INDEX IX_KD ON T (K DESC). Reads the IX_K2 and IX_KD walks after the reinsert. Asks what drop, rebuild, delete and reinsert change in the file and whether a rebuilt or maintained index lists ties in the same order as the original build.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
